{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38708","headline":"句 · 吴仁璧","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲惜苔钱妨换砌，因怜山色旋开尊。\n高阁烟霞禅客睡，满城尘土世人忙。\n五龙金角向星斗，三洞玉音愁鬼神。\n蒲草薄裁连蒂白，臙脂浓染半葩红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴仁璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}